---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Screen from '../components/Screen.astro';
---

<Layout title="Tusk" wide={true}>
  <Screen>
    <div class="banner tusk-banner">
      <div class="tusk-icon">∫</div>
      <div class="banner-content">
        <h1 class="tusk-title">Tusk</h1>
        <p class="tusk-subtitle">The Master Integration Engine</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="page-content">

      <!-- Hero -->
      <div class="tusk-hero">
        <p class="tusk-tagline">A pure Rust TUI calculus engine that visualizes integration step-by-step using heuristic transformations and the Risch algorithm.</p>
        <div class="tusk-badges">
          <span class="ui-badge tusk-badge-rust">Rust</span>
          <span class="ui-badge tusk-badge-mit">MIT License</span>
          <span class="ui-badge tusk-badge-tui">TUI</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Live Web Engine -->
      <h2 id="demo">Live Web Engine</h2>
      <div class="tusk-terminal" id="tuskTerminal">
        <div class="term-titlebar">
          <span class="term-dot red"></span>
          <span class="term-dot yellow"></span>
          <span class="term-dot green"></span>
          <span class="term-title">tusk v0.1.0</span>
        </div>
        <div class="term-body">
          <div class="term-row">
            <span class="term-prompt">tusk ▸</span>
            <input type="text" id="tuskInput" class="term-input" placeholder="Type an expression… e.g. int(x * sin(x), x)" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" />
            <span class="term-ghost" id="tuskGhost"></span>
          </div>
          <div class="term-output" id="tuskOutput">
            <div class="term-hint">Try clicking: <code class="clickable-hint">x + 0</code>, <code class="clickable-hint">int(x * sin(x), x)</code>, <code class="clickable-hint">int(x * exp(x), x)</code></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Documentation -->
      <h2 id="docs">Language Documentation</h2>
      <div class="docs-grid">
        <div class="docs-card">
          <h3>Basic Arithmetic</h3>
          <p>Tusk supports standard mathematical operators and precedence.</p>
          <ul>
            <li><code>+</code> Addition: <code>x + 1</code></li>
            <li><code>-</code> Subtraction: <code>2 - x</code></li>
            <li><code>*</code> Multiplication: <code>3 * x</code></li>
            <li><code>/</code> Division: <code>x / 2</code></li>
            <li><code>^</code> Exponentiation: <code>x^2</code></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="docs-card">
          <h3>Functions</h3>
          <p>Built-in mathematical functions require parentheses.</p>
          <ul>
            <li><code>sin(x)</code> Sine</li>
            <li><code>cos(x)</code> Cosine</li>
            <li><code>exp(x)</code> Exponential</li>
            <li><code>ln(x)</code> Natural Logarithm</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="docs-card">
          <h3>Integration</h3>
          <p>The <code>int()</code> command calculates the indefinite integral.</p>
          <ul>
            <li><code>int(expr, var)</code></li>
            <li>Example: <code>int(x^2, x)</code></li>
            <li>Example: <code>int(x * sin(x), x)</code></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Pipeline -->
      <h2 id="pipeline">Transformation Pipeline</h2>
      <div class="pipeline-grid">
        <div class="pipeline-card">
          <div class="pipeline-num">01</div>
          <h3>Phase Zero</h3>
          <p>Algebraic simplification: constant folding, identity elimination (<code>x+0</code>, <code>x*1</code>), trig identities (<code>sin(0)=0</code>).</p>
        </div>
        <div class="pipeline-card">
          <div class="pipeline-num">02</div>
          <h3>Substitution</h3>
          <p>Heuristic u-substitution matching — detects functional compositions and exact differentials inside integrands.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="pipeline-card">
          <div class="pipeline-num">03</div>
          <h3>ALPES</h3>
          <p>Integration by Parts scored by the LIATE heuristic: <strong>L</strong>og &gt; <strong>A</strong>lgebraic &gt; <strong>L</strong>(dup) &gt; <strong>P</strong>(dup) &gt; <strong>E</strong>xp &gt; <strong>S</strong>in/Cos.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="pipeline-card">
          <div class="pipeline-num">04</div>
          <h3>Hermite Reduction</h3>
          <p>Risch algorithm fallback for rational functions — square-free factorization and Rothstein-Trager decomposition.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Architecture -->
      <h2 id="arch">Architecture</h2>
      <div class="arch-grid">
        <div class="arch-file"><code>ast.rs</code><span>Recursive Expr enum + nom parser + Display</span></div>
        <div class="arch-file"><code>engine.rs</code><span>TuskEngine orchestrator, Step/Transform traits</span></div>
        <div class="arch-file"><code>heuristics.rs</code><span>Phase Zero, ALPES IBP, Substitution rules</span></div>
        <div class="arch-file"><code>calculus.rs</code><span>Symbolic derive() and simple_integrate()</span></div>
        <div class="arch-file"><code>risch.rs</code><span>Hermite Reduction for rational functions</span></div>
        <div class="arch-file"><code>ui.rs</code><span>Ratatui TUI with time-travel + autocomplete</span></div>
      </div>

      <!-- Install -->
      <h2 id="install">Install</h2>
      <div class="tusk-terminal" style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
        <div class="term-titlebar">
          <span class="term-dot red"></span>
          <span class="term-dot yellow"></span>
          <span class="term-dot green"></span>
          <span class="term-title">terminal</span>
        </div>
        <div class="term-body" style="padding: 1rem 1.2rem;">
          <pre class="install-pre"><span class="term-comment"># Clone and build</span>
<span class="term-cmd">git clone</span> https://github.com/AKRiLLiCK/tusk.git
<span class="term-cmd">cd</span> tusk
<span class="term-cmd">cargo run</span></pre>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="tusk-cta">
        <a href="https://github.com/AKRiLLiCK/tusk" target="_blank" class="ui-button tusk-btn-primary">View on GitHub</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <script>
      document.addEventListener('astro:page-load', () => {
        const input = document.getElementById('tuskInput') as HTMLInputElement;
        const ghost = document.getElementById('tuskGhost');
        const output = document.getElementById('tuskOutput');
        if (!input || !ghost || !output) return;

        const COMMANDS = ['int(', 'sin(', 'cos(', 'exp(', 'ln('];

        function getSuggestion(text: string): string {
          const match = text.match(/([a-zA-Z]+)$/);
          if (!match) return '';
          const word = match[1];
          for (const cmd of COMMANDS) {
            if (cmd.startsWith(word) && cmd !== word) return cmd.slice(word.length);
          }
          return '';
        }

        // Phase Zero simplification rules (mirrors the Rust engine)
        type Expr =
          | { type: 'const'; value: number }
          | { type: 'var'; name: string }
          | { type: 'add'; l: Expr; r: Expr }
          | { type: 'sub'; l: Expr; r: Expr }
          | { type: 'mul'; l: Expr; r: Expr }
          | { type: 'pow'; base: Expr; exp: Expr }
          | { type: 'sin'; inner: Expr }
          | { type: 'cos'; inner: Expr }
          | { type: 'exp'; inner: Expr }
          | { type: 'ln'; inner: Expr }
          | { type: 'int'; integrand: Expr; variable: string };

        function tokenize(s: string): string[] {
          const tokens: string[] = [];
          let i = 0;
          while (i < s.length) {
            if (/\s/.test(s[i])) { i++; continue; }
            if ('+-*/^(),'.includes(s[i])) { tokens.push(s[i]); i++; continue; }
            if (/[0-9]/.test(s[i]) || (s[i] === '-' && (tokens.length === 0 || '(,+-*/^'.includes(tokens[tokens.length-1])))) {
              let num = '';
              if (s[i] === '-') { num += s[i]; i++; }
              while (i < s.length && /[0-9.]/.test(s[i])) { num += s[i]; i++; }
              tokens.push(num); continue;
            }
            if (/[a-zA-Z]/.test(s[i])) {
              let word = '';
              while (i < s.length && /[a-zA-Z]/.test(s[i])) { word += s[i]; i++; }
              tokens.push(word); continue;
            }
            i++;
          }
          return tokens;
        }

        function parseExpr(tokens: string[], pos: number): [Expr, number] {
          let [left, p] = parseTerm(tokens, pos);
          while (p < tokens.length && (tokens[p] === '+' || tokens[p] === '-')) {
            const op = tokens[p]; p++;
            const [right, p2] = parseTerm(tokens, p);
            left = op === '+' ? { type: 'add', l: left, r: right } : { type: 'sub', l: left, r: right };
            p = p2;
          }
          return [left, p];
        }

        function parseTerm(tokens: string[], pos: number): [Expr, number] {
          let [left, p] = parsePower(tokens, pos);
          while (p < tokens.length && (tokens[p] === '*' || tokens[p] === '/')) {
            const op = tokens[p]; p++;
            const [right, p2] = parsePower(tokens, p);
            left = op === '*' ? { type: 'mul', l: left, r: right } : { type: 'mul', l: { type: 'const', value: 1 }, r: right };
            p = p2;
          }
          return [left, p];
        }

        function parsePower(tokens: string[], pos: number): [Expr, number] {
          let [base, p] = parseFactor(tokens, pos);
          if (p < tokens.length && tokens[p] === '^') {
            p++;
            const [exp, p2] = parsePower(tokens, p);
            return [{ type: 'pow', base, exp }, p2];
          }
          return [base, p];
        }

        function parseFactor(tokens: string[], pos: number): [Expr, number] {
          const t = tokens[pos];
          if (!t) return [{ type: 'const', value: 0 }, pos];

          // Functions
          const funcs = ['sin', 'cos', 'exp', 'ln'];
          if (funcs.includes(t) && tokens[pos+1] === '(') {
            const [inner, p] = parseExpr(tokens, pos + 2);
            const end = tokens[p] === ')' ? p + 1 : p;
            return [{ type: t as 'sin'|'cos'|'exp'|'ln', inner }, end];
          }

          // Integral
          if (t === 'int' && tokens[pos+1] === '(') {
            const [integrand, p] = parseExpr(tokens, pos + 2);
            let variable = 'x';
            let end = p;
            if (tokens[p] === ',') {
              variable = tokens[p+1] || 'x';
              end = p + 2;
            }
            if (tokens[end] === ')') end++;
            return [{ type: 'int', integrand, variable }, end];
          }

          // Parens
          if (t === '(') {
            const [inner, p] = parseExpr(tokens, pos + 1);
            return [inner, tokens[p] === ')' ? p + 1 : p];
          }

          // Number
          if (/^-?[0-9]/.test(t)) return [{ type: 'const', value: parseFloat(t) }, pos + 1];

          // Variable
          if (/^[a-zA-Z]/.test(t)) return [{ type: 'var', name: t }, pos + 1];

          return [{ type: 'const', value: 0 }, pos + 1];
        }

        function tryParse(s: string): Expr | null {
          try {
            const tokens = tokenize(s);
            if (tokens.length === 0) return null;
            const [expr] = parseExpr(tokens, 0);
            return expr;
          } catch { return null; }
        }

        function exprToStr(e: Expr): string {
          switch (e.type) {
            case 'const': return Number.isInteger(e.value) ? e.value.toString() : e.value.toFixed(2);
            case 'var': return e.name;
            case 'add': return `(${exprToStr(e.l)} + ${exprToStr(e.r)})`;
            case 'sub': return `(${exprToStr(e.l)} - ${exprToStr(e.r)})`;
            case 'mul': {
              if (e.l.type === 'const' && e.l.value === -1) return `-${exprToStr(e.r)}`;
              return `(${exprToStr(e.l)} · ${exprToStr(e.r)})`;
            }
            case 'pow': return `${exprToStr(e.base)}^${exprToStr(e.exp)}`;
            case 'sin': return `sin(${exprToStr(e.inner)})`;
            case 'cos': return `cos(${exprToStr(e.inner)})`;
            case 'exp': return `exp(${exprToStr(e.inner)})`;
            case 'ln': return `ln(${exprToStr(e.inner)})`;
            case 'int': return `∫ ${exprToStr(e.integrand)} d${e.variable}`;
          }
        }

        interface Step { desc: string; expr: Expr }

        function simplify(e: Expr): Expr | null {
          if (e.type === 'add') {
            const sl = simplify(e.l); if (sl) return { type: 'add', l: sl, r: e.r };
            const sr = simplify(e.r); if (sr) return { type: 'add', l: e.l, r: sr };
            if (e.l.type === 'const' && e.r.type === 'const') return { type: 'const', value: e.l.value + e.r.value };
            if (e.l.type === 'const' && e.l.value === 0) return e.r;
            if (e.r.type === 'const' && e.r.value === 0) return e.l;
          }
          if (e.type === 'sub') {
            const sl = simplify(e.l); if (sl) return { type: 'sub', l: sl, r: e.r };
            const sr = simplify(e.r); if (sr) return { type: 'sub', l: e.l, r: sr };
            if (e.l.type === 'const' && e.r.type === 'const') return { type: 'const', value: e.l.value - e.r.value };
            if (e.r.type === 'const' && e.r.value === 0) return e.l;
            if (e.l.type === 'const' && e.l.value === 0) return { type: 'mul', l: { type: 'const', value: -1 }, r: e.r };
          }
          if (e.type === 'mul') {
            const sl = simplify(e.l); if (sl) return { type: 'mul', l: sl, r: e.r };
            const sr = simplify(e.r); if (sr) return { type: 'mul', l: e.l, r: sr };
            if (e.l.type === 'const' && e.r.type === 'const') return { type: 'const', value: e.l.value * e.r.value };
            if ((e.l.type === 'const' && e.l.value === 0) || (e.r.type === 'const' && e.r.value === 0)) return { type: 'const', value: 0 };
            if (e.l.type === 'const' && e.l.value === 1) return e.r;
            if (e.r.type === 'const' && e.r.value === 1) return e.l;
            if (e.l.type === 'const' && e.r.type === 'mul' && e.r.l.type === 'const') {
              return { type: 'mul', l: { type: 'const', value: e.l.value * e.r.l.value }, r: e.r.r };
            }
          }
          if (e.type === 'pow') {
            if (e.exp.type === 'const' && e.exp.value === 0) return { type: 'const', value: 1 };
            if (e.exp.type === 'const' && e.exp.value === 1) return e.base;
          }
          if (e.type === 'sin' && e.inner.type === 'const' && e.inner.value === 0) return { type: 'const', value: 0 };
          if (e.type === 'cos' && e.inner.type === 'const' && e.inner.value === 0) return { type: 'const', value: 1 };
          if (e.type === 'int') {
            const si = simplify(e.integrand);
            if (si) return { type: 'int', integrand: si, variable: e.variable };
          }
          return null;
        }

        function heuristic(e: Expr): { expr: Expr, desc: string } | null {
          if (e.type === 'int') {
            const v = e.variable;
            const i = e.integrand;
            
            if (i.type === 'cos' && i.inner.type === 'var' && i.inner.name === v) return { desc: 'Standard Integral', expr: { type: 'sin', inner: i.inner } };
            if (i.type === 'sin' && i.inner.type === 'var' && i.inner.name === v) return { desc: 'Standard Integral', expr: { type: 'mul', l: { type: 'const', value: -1 }, r: { type: 'cos', inner: i.inner } } };
            if (i.type === 'exp' && i.inner.type === 'var' && i.inner.name === v) return { desc: 'Standard Integral', expr: { type: 'exp', inner: i.inner } };
            if (i.type === 'const') return { desc: 'Power Rule', expr: { type: 'mul', l: i, r: { type: 'var', name: v } } };
            if (i.type === 'var' && i.name === v) return { desc: 'Power Rule', expr: { type: 'mul', l: { type: 'const', value: 0.5 }, r: { type: 'pow', base: i, exp: { type: 'const', value: 2 } } } };
            if (i.type === 'pow' && i.base.type === 'var' && i.base.name === v && i.exp.type === 'const' && i.exp.value !== -1) {
               const n = i.exp.value;
               const frac = Number.isInteger(1 / (n + 1)) ? (1 / (n + 1)) : Number((1 / (n + 1)).toFixed(3));
               return { desc: 'Power Rule', expr: { type: 'mul', l: { type: 'const', value: frac }, r: { type: 'pow', base: i.base, exp: { type: 'const', value: n + 1 } } } };
            }
            
            if (i.type === 'mul' && i.l.type === 'var' && i.l.name === v) {
               if (i.r.type === 'sin' && i.r.inner.type === 'var' && i.r.inner.name === v) {
                 return { desc: 'ALPES (IBP): u = x, dv = sin(x)', expr: { type: 'add', l: { type: 'mul', l: { type: 'mul', l: { type: 'const', value: -1 }, r: i.l }, r: { type: 'cos', inner: i.r.inner } }, r: { type: 'int', integrand: { type: 'cos', inner: i.r.inner }, variable: v } } };
               }
               if (i.r.type === 'cos' && i.r.inner.type === 'var' && i.r.inner.name === v) {
                 return { desc: 'ALPES (IBP): u = x, dv = cos(x)', expr: { type: 'sub', l: { type: 'mul', l: i.l, r: { type: 'sin', inner: i.r.inner } }, r: { type: 'int', integrand: { type: 'sin', inner: i.r.inner }, variable: v } } };
               }
               if (i.r.type === 'exp' && i.r.inner.type === 'var' && i.r.inner.name === v) {
                 return { desc: 'ALPES (IBP): u = x, dv = exp(x)', expr: { type: 'sub', l: { type: 'mul', l: i.l, r: { type: 'exp', inner: i.r.inner } }, r: { type: 'int', integrand: { type: 'exp', inner: i.r.inner }, variable: v } } };
               }
            }
            if (i.type === 'mul' && i.l.type === 'const') {
               return { desc: 'Linearity', expr: { type: 'mul', l: i.l, r: { type: 'int', integrand: i.r, variable: v } } };
            }
            if (i.type === 'add') {
               return { desc: 'Sum Rule', expr: { type: 'add', l: { type: 'int', integrand: i.l, variable: v }, r: { type: 'int', integrand: i.r, variable: v } } };
            }
          }
          
          if (e.type === 'add') {
             const l = heuristic(e.l); if (l) return { desc: l.desc, expr: { type: 'add', l: l.expr, r: e.r } };
             const r = heuristic(e.r); if (r) return { desc: r.desc, expr: { type: 'add', l: e.l, r: r.expr } };
          }
          if (e.type === 'sub') {
             const l = heuristic(e.l); if (l) return { desc: l.desc, expr: { type: 'sub', l: l.expr, r: e.r } };
             const r = heuristic(e.r); if (r) return { desc: r.desc, expr: { type: 'sub', l: e.l, r: r.expr } };
          }
          if (e.type === 'mul') {
             const l = heuristic(e.l); if (l) return { desc: l.desc, expr: { type: 'mul', l: l.expr, r: e.r } };
             const r = heuristic(e.r); if (r) return { desc: r.desc, expr: { type: 'mul', l: e.l, r: r.expr } };
          }
          return null;
        }

        function runEngine(expr: Expr): Step[] {
          const steps: Step[] = [];
          let current = expr;
          for (let i = 0; i < 20; i++) {
            const s = simplify(current);
            if (s) {
              steps.push({ desc: 'Phase Zero', expr: s });
              current = s;
              continue;
            }
            const h = heuristic(current);
            if (h) {
              steps.push({ desc: h.desc, expr: h.expr });
              current = h.expr;
              continue;
            }
            break;
          }
          return steps;
        }

        function renderSteps(steps: Step[], final_expr: Expr) {
          if (steps.length === 0) {
            output!.innerHTML = `<div class="step-row final"><span class="step-marker">✓</span> <span class="step-desc">Parsed:</span> <span class="step-expr">${exprToStr(final_expr)}</span></div>`;
            return;
          }
          let html = '';
          steps.forEach((s, i) => {
            html += `<div class="step-row"><span class="step-num">[${i+1}/${steps.length}]</span> <span class="step-desc">${s.desc}:</span> <span class="step-expr">${exprToStr(s.expr)}</span></div>`;
          });
          html += `<div class="step-row final"><span class="step-marker">✓</span> <span class="step-desc">Final Result:</span> <span class="step-expr">${exprToStr(final_expr)}</span></div>`;
          output!.innerHTML = html;
        }

        input.addEventListener('input', () => {
          const val = input.value;
          ghost!.textContent = getSuggestion(val);
          const expr = tryParse(val);
          if (!expr || val.trim() === '') {
            output!.innerHTML = '<div class="term-hint">Try clicking: <code class="clickable-hint">x + 0</code>, <code class="clickable-hint">int(x * sin(x), x)</code>, <code class="clickable-hint">int(x * exp(x), x)</code></div>';
            bindHints();
            return;
          }
          const steps = runEngine(expr);
          const final_expr = steps.length > 0 ? steps[steps.length - 1].expr : expr;
          renderSteps(steps, final_expr);
        });

        function bindHints() {
          document.querySelectorAll('.clickable-hint').forEach(el => {
            el.addEventListener('click', () => {
              input.value = el.textContent || '';
              input.dispatchEvent(new Event('input'));
            });
            el.style.cursor = 'pointer';
            el.style.textDecoration = 'underline';
          });
        }
        bindHints();

        input.addEventListener('keydown', (e: KeyboardEvent) => {
          if (e.key === 'Tab') {
            e.preventDefault();
            const suggestion = getSuggestion(input.value);
            if (suggestion) {
              input.value += suggestion;
              input.dispatchEvent(new Event('input'));
            }
          }
        });
      });
    </script>

    <style>
      /* ── Tusk Banner ─────────────────────────── */
      .tusk-banner {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 1.5rem;
        background: linear-gradient(180deg, #1a1225 0%, #0d0a14 100%);
        border-bottom: 2px solid #2a1f3d;
        padding: 2.5rem 1.5rem;
        text-align: center;
      }
      .tusk-icon {
        font-size: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 4.5rem);
        color: #b48cff;
        text-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(180, 140, 255, 0.4);
        font-family: serif;
        line-height: 1;
      }
      .tusk-title {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 6vw, 2.8rem);
        letter-spacing: 3px;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #b48cff, #78dcb4);
        -webkit-background-clip: text;
        -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
        background-clip: text;
      }
      .tusk-subtitle {
        margin: 0.3rem 0 0 0;
        color: #666;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        letter-spacing: 1px;
      }

      /* ── Hero ─────────────────────────────────── */
      .tusk-hero {
        text-align: center;
        padding: 1.5rem 0 1rem;
      }
      .tusk-tagline {
        color: #999;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        max-width: 560px;
        margin: 0 auto 1rem;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }
      .tusk-badges { display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 0.5rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
      .tusk-badge-rust { color: #ff8264; border-color: rgba(255, 130, 100, 0.3); }
      .tusk-badge-mit { color: #78dcb4; border-color: rgba(120, 220, 180, 0.3); }
      .tusk-badge-tui { color: #b48cff; border-color: rgba(180, 140, 255, 0.3); }

      /* ── Terminal ─────────────────────────────── */
      .tusk-terminal {
        border: 1px solid #2a2a3a;
        border-radius: 10px;
        overflow: hidden;
        background: #0e0e16;
        box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.6);
        margin-bottom: 2rem;
      }
      .term-titlebar {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 6px;
        padding: 8px 12px;
        background: #1a1a24;
        border-bottom: 1px solid #2a2a3a;
      }
      .term-dot { width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%; }
      .term-dot.red { background: #ff5f57; }
      .term-dot.yellow { background: #febc2e; }
      .term-dot.green { background: #28c840; }
      .term-title { margin-left: auto; color: #555; font-size: 0.75rem; font-family: monospace; }
      .term-body { padding: 1rem 1.2rem; }
      .term-row {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 0.5rem;
        position: relative;
      }
      .term-prompt {
        color: #b48cff;
        font-family: monospace;
        font-weight: bold;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        flex-shrink: 0;
      }
      .term-input {
        flex: 1;
        background: none;
        border: none;
        color: #ffdc64;
        font-family: monospace;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        outline: none;
        caret-color: #b48cff;
      }
      .term-input::placeholder { color: #3a3a4a; }
      .term-ghost {
        color: #3a3a50;
        font-family: monospace;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        pointer-events: none;
        position: absolute;
        left: 0;
        white-space: pre;
        opacity: 0;
      }
      .term-hint {
        color: #444;
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        margin-top: 0.8rem;
        font-family: monospace;
      }
      .term-hint code {
        color: #666;
        background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
        padding: 1px 5px;
        border-radius: 3px;
      }
      .term-output { margin-top: 0.8rem; }
      .step-row {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        align-items: baseline;
        gap: 0.2rem 0.6rem;
        padding: 4px 0;
        font-family: monospace;
        font-size: 0.82rem;
        border-left: 2px solid #2a2a3a;
        padding-left: 0.8rem;
        margin-bottom: 2px;
      }
      .step-row.final { border-left-color: #78dcb4; }
      .step-num { color: #ff8264; font-weight: bold; flex-shrink: 0; }
      .step-marker { color: #78dcb4; font-weight: bold; flex-shrink: 0; }
      .step-desc { color: #888; flex-shrink: 0; }
      .step-expr { color: #78dcb4; }

      .install-pre {
        margin: 0;
        font-family: monospace;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        line-height: 1.8;
        color: #aaa;
        white-space: pre-wrap;
        word-break: break-all;
      }
      .term-comment { color: #555; }
      .term-cmd { color: #b48cff; font-weight: bold; }

      /* ── Documentation ────────────────────────── */
      .docs-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(240px, 1fr));
        gap: 1rem;
        margin-bottom: 2rem;
      }
      .docs-card {
        background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02);
        border: 1px solid #222;
        border-radius: 8px;
        padding: 1.2rem;
      }
      .docs-card h3 { color: #ffdc64; margin: 0 0 0.5rem; font-size: 1rem; }
      .docs-card p { color: #aaa; font-size: 0.85rem; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0.8rem; }
      .docs-card ul { margin: 0; padding-left: 1.2rem; color: #888; font-size: 0.82rem; line-height: 1.6; }
      .docs-card code { color: #78dcb4; background: rgba(120,220,180,0.08); padding: 1px 4px; border-radius: 3px; font-size: 0.8rem; }

      /* ── Pipeline ─────────────────────────────── */
      .pipeline-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(220px, 1fr));
        gap: 1rem;
        margin-bottom: 2rem;
      }
      .pipeline-card {
        background: rgba(180, 140, 255, 0.04);
        border: 1px solid #2a2a3a;
        border-radius: 8px;
        padding: 1.2rem;
        position: relative;
        box-shadow: inset 0 0 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
      }
      .pipeline-card h3 { color: #b48cff; margin: 0 0 0.5rem; font-size: 1rem; }
      .pipeline-card p { color: #888; font-size: 0.82rem; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0; }
      .pipeline-card code { color: #78dcb4; background: rgba(120,220,180,0.08); padding: 1px 4px; border-radius: 3px; font-size: 0.8rem; }
      .pipeline-num {
        position: absolute;
        top: 0.8rem;
        right: 1rem;
        font-size: 1.8rem;
        font-weight: 900;
        color: rgba(180, 140, 255, 0.1);
        font-family: monospace;
      }

      /* ── Architecture ─────────────────────────── */
      .arch-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(260px, 1fr));
        gap: 0.6rem;
        margin-bottom: 2rem;
      }
      .arch-file {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 0.8rem;
        padding: 0.7rem 1rem;
        background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
        border: 1px solid #222;
        border-radius: 6px;
        font-size: 0.82rem;
      }
      .arch-file code {
        color: #ffdc64;
        background: rgba(255,220,100,0.08);
        padding: 2px 6px;
        border-radius: 4px;
        font-weight: bold;
        flex-shrink: 0;
      }
      .arch-file span { color: #777; }

      /* ── CTA ──────────────────────────────────── */
      .tusk-cta { text-align: center; padding-bottom: 2rem; }
      .tusk-btn-primary {
        background: linear-gradient(180deg, #3a2a5a 0%, #1a1225 100%) !important;
        border-color: #4a3a6a !important;
        color: #b48cff !important;
        padding: 10px 28px !important;
        font-size: 0.95rem !important;
      }
      .tusk-btn-primary:active {
        background: linear-gradient(180deg, #1a1225 0%, #0d0a14 100%) !important;
      }
    </style>
  </Screen>
</Layout>
